    },
    {
      "text": "The user gazes at the target rather charmingly,\nmaking it less wary. This harshly lowers the target’s\nAttack stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "かわいく　みつめて　油断を　誘い\n相手の　攻撃を　がくっと　さげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可爱地凝视，\n诱使对手疏忽大意，\n从而大幅降低对手的攻击。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Engatusa al objetivo y reduce mucho su Ataque.",
      "version_group": {
